# ============================================================================
# SECURITY NOTE
# ============================================================================
# Never commit files containing sensitive information like:
# - Secret keys
# - Database passwords
# - API keys
# - Email credentials
# - OAuth secrets
# - Private keys
# - Environment variables with real credentials
# - Local settings files